
Privacy Policy for Delta Seek

Effective Date: 01-08-2025

Introduction
At Fortune Mint, we take your privacy seriously. This privacy policy outlines how we handle your data when you use the Fortune Mint mobile application. By using the app, you agree to the terms of this privacy policy.

Data Collection
Fortune Mint does not collect, process, or transmit any personal data. All information, including images, records of costs, and quantities of coins, is stored locally on your device.

Data Usage

Local Data Storage: All your information remains private and secure on your device.
No Data Sharing: Fortune Mint does not share, sell, or transmit your data to third parties or external servers.
3. Internet Access

Offline Functionality: Fortune Mint is designed to work entirely offline. The app does not require internet access for any of its features.
No Third-Party Tracking: We do not integrate with analytics tools, ad services, or any third-party APIs that could compromise your privacy.
4. Data Security
While Fortune Mint takes no active role in securing your data (since it is stored locally), we recommend that you:

Use your device’s security features, such as passcodes, biometric locks, or encryption.
Regularly back up your data if needed.
5. Third-Party Services
Fortune Mint does not integrate with or rely on any third-party services, ensuring complete control over your data.

Your Responsibilities
As the user, you are responsible for:
Keeping your device secure.
Avoiding unauthorized access to your device and the Fortune Mint app.
7. Changes to This Privacy Policy
Fortune Mint may update this privacy policy to reflect changes in legal requirements or app functionality. Any updates will be posted in the app’s description on the Google Play Store. We encourage you to review the privacy policy periodically.

Disclaimer
No Liability for Data Loss: Fortune Mint is not liable for any data loss due to device damage, theft, or malfunction.
Not Financial Advice: Fortune Mint does not provide financial advice or valuation tools. It is solely for record-keeping purposes.
9. Compliance with Google Play Store Policies
This privacy policy complies with Google Play Store’s requirements for transparency and user data protection. Fortune Mint does not collect personal data, ensuring it aligns with the Data Safety Section.
